    <div class="docs-getstarted-code">
<pre><code>New:
  - Surface (sui-surface) — paints the SoftUI background, text color, and
    font on a section, so components render correctly inside existing sites
  - Scoped themes — data-theme="dark" / "light" now works on any element,
    not just &lt;html&gt; (shadow tokens re-resolve per section)

Fixes:
  - sui-flat now removes the shadow of the element it is on, including
    hover and active states; keyboard focus keeps a visible ring. Inner
    parts such as toggle knobs and range thumbs keep their shadows (see
    sui-flat-all in v1.16.0 to flatten a whole area)

Docs:
  - "Using in an Existing Site" section on Getting Started
  - Scoped themes on the Theming page
  - "Flat on Any Background" demo on the Shadows page</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

